 "description": "Welcome to Vintage Christmas Lights UK (@vcluk) — the home of classic British Christmas tree lights, retro fairy light restorations, and spare bulb guides for the UK domestic market.\n\nFrom rare collectibles to classic 1970s–2000s sets, we celebrate, repair, and preserve nostalgic incandescent lighting. Whether you are fixing a dead series loop, finding blown bulbs, or sourcing replacement MES (E10) screw-in and push-in lamps for Pifco, NOMA, Mazda, Osram, or Woolworths Winfield sets, we keep the warm festive glow alive!\n\n🔧 ON THE CHANNEL:\n• Step-by-step 240V mains restorations & safety testing\n• Bulb diagnostics, continuity checks & shunt fixes\n• Rare vintage musical lights & novelty showcases\n• Collector archive research & history\n\n💡 Join The Spare Bulb Club (£1.99/mo):\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKMXmlMdSRJvizNG31G25zA/join\n\n🌐 FIND US:\n• Second channel: @vintagelightsuk\n• Instagram: @vintagechristmaslightsuk\n\n📧 Business enquiries: see email below.",
